    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I don’t care that you are Marked. I’ve said it before. These weeks with you have been the best parts of my existence.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 795
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Lavina",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3612
        },
        {
          "text": "I. Fear. Nobody.” He stresses each word. “I’ve let you manage this how you’re comfortable",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3619
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Just so we are clear, I want you, all of you",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3762
        },
        {
          "text": "with or without a mark.” He leans closer. “If it were up to me, I’d take you to my ship right now and keep you for mysel",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3807
        }
      ],
      "words": 37
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Draven? I think you have to leave.” My voice cracks—I’m speaking with courage before it’s gone",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6241
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I don’t know how to let you in like you deserve",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7213
        },
        {
          "text": "like I want to,” I admit, tears falling freely",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7260
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I am yours, even if you choose not to want me later.” His brows furrow as he says it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9132
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“For not pushing further.” I look up into his eyes, still longing for more",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12314
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    }
  ],
